<title>AUSTRIA: Verbund details H1 results.</title>
<headline>Verbund details H1 results.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>In the first six months to June 30, 1996.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of schillings unless stated)</p>
<p>						     1996	   1995</p>
<p>    Group operating (earnings before   1,580.8  vs  1,980.9</p>
<p>			  interest and tax)</p>
<p>    Group pre-tax				864.0  vs    639.0</p>
<p>    Group net				    765.6  vs    539.8</p>
<p>    Group sales			     10,396.8  vs  9,519.5</p>
<p>    Group depreciation		     2,055.2  vs  1,932.6</p>
<p>    Group personnel costs		  2,863.3  vs  2,919.3</p>
<p>    Group workforce			  4,684   vs  4,982</p>
<p>NOTE - Full company name is Oesterreichische Elektrizitaetswirtschafts AG (Verbund).</p>
</text>
